    "detailed_description": "Train your folks, upgrade your town and battle monsters in this minimalist retro-looking strategy RPG!<br><br>CHECK OUT THE OST HERE :<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Train Your Folks!</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909420/extras/c124809622de3eee1a9730967488b5bc.webp?t=1667311256\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>20+ different classes with unique stats and abilities<br></li><li>15+ different weapons<br></li><li>20+ artefacts with unique effects</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Upgrade Your town!</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909420/extras/fe0bc78e72c9854a9707abf5934d3c16.avif?t=1667311256\" /></div><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>7 different buildings with unique activities<br></li><li>Combine classes, craft items, pay for researches or one time bonuses<br></li><li>Upgrade each building to unlock new activities</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Battle Monsters!</strong></h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1909420/extras/c7911264a18b45171aa619b4c699b210.webp?t=1667311256\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>13 Unique biomes<br></li><li>70+ Monsters to defeat<br></li><li>Boss Battles, amazing loot</li></ul><br>All In Crisp <strong>pixel Art Graphics</strong>!<br><strong>The town needs you, lead your folks to victory and defeat the evil Sorcerer!</strong><br><br>If you need to reach out about anything, please send an email to <a href=\"mailto:vandermaesengames@gmail.com\">vandermaesengames@gmail.com</a>",
